    "subject": "/root/augmented-lange-lerner/docs/Lange–Lerner_Model.pdf",
    "text": "The production possibilities set is defined by the following equation: This equation states that the total output of goods produced by all the firms in the economy at time t must be equal to the consumption of goods by all households after the inputs for production have been subtracted along with investment.",
