    "status": "DECLARED",
    "subject": "/root/augmented-lange-lerner/docs/Lange–Lerner_Model.pdf",
    "text": "Together these give the total asset value of the firm, so that: (f )           (f )⊤ ⃗ (f ) ⃗ t ) = ⃗μt Π(f ) (K                     Kt + ⃗λ⊤         ⃗ t (I − ∆)Kt                      (27) Hence we can write the following expression for the problem of maximizing the intertem- poral profits: ∞ X        h     \u0010 \u0011       \u0010       \u0011i (f ) ⃗ Π (f ) =     max               β t Πt    Kt − ⃗λ⊤ t ⃗ t+1 K                        (28) ⃗ t+1 }∞ {K      t=0   t=0",
    "text_hash": "e389e6d25496ce5251ed7f0f2c950ef08f72b67f1d78acfa44a143d4f871e293",
    "type": "number",
    "value": "0"
  },
  {
    "certs": [],
    "checkable": "machine",
