    "status": "DECLARED",
    "subject": "/root/augmented-lange-lerner/docs/Lange–Lerner_Model.pdf",
    "text": "⃗ t(f ) ∥ ≤ (1 − δmin )t ∥K so ∥K                         ⃗ 0(f ) ∥ + C for some constant C ≥ 0 depending on the investment sequence.",
    "text_hash": "90a05966038864d2209e3378c342683a9695b5b2025cc7fa2b609ffa959ddfe2",
    "type": "number",
    "value": "0"
  },
