    "subject": "/root/augmented-lange-lerner/docs/Lange–Lerner_Model.pdf",
    "text": "The objective W = ∞ P        t PH          ⃗ t=0 β    h=1 wh uh (Ch,t ) is a positive weighted sum of concave func- t tions scaled by β > 0, hence jointly concave in {C    ⃗ h,t }.",
    "text_hash": "a5d1ca94ace947c830853825fdad652650d5e6f06cea26ce579cd1a8ca2c9d87",
