    "subject": "/root/augmented-lange-lerner/docs/Lange–Lerner_Model.pdf",
    "text": "The dual function is defined as H X          h                   i XF                       h                        i (f ) ⃗       ⃗⊤ ⃗ Qt (⃗λt , νt ) =                  ⃗        ⃗ ⊤⃗ sup wh uh (Ch,t ) − λt Ch,t +              sup            Πt (K   t ) − λt Kt+1 + νt L, (34) ⃗                                        (f ) ⃗ t+1 h=1 Ch,t                               f =1 q⃗t , K",
    "text_hash": "29a774e1f42c192820fa86e58b9690216637efb36dfc16b5a998d370a68f39b6",
    "type": "number",
    "value": "1"
