    "status": "DECLARED",
    "subject": "/root/augmented-lange-lerner/docs/Lange–Lerner_Model.pdf",
    "text": "The policy rule is locally exact: given the current capital stock K⃗ t(f ) and the optimal (f ) ⃗ t+1 next-period stock K        determined by the Bellman equation, there always exist parameters (f ) ⃗ (f ) (At , bt ) satisfying the rule exactly, since each component reduces to a line through a single point in two unknowns.",
    "text_hash": "373b29e3c9771ae77a8c619e3276ac8179983704e5a3acc1d6b6a1df1d13de1c",
    "type": "theorem"
  },
  {
    "certs": [],
    "checkable": "machine",
    "falsifier": false,
    "id": "SRC-LANGE-LERNER-MODEL-e2b101c0-C045",
    "method": "deterministic",
    "provenance": "claim_ingest deterministic:quantifier",
    "risk": "exploratory",
    "section": "body",
    "source_id": "SRC-LANGE-LERNER-MODEL-e2b101c0",
    "status": "DECLARED",
    "subject": "/root/augmented-lange-lerner/docs/Lange–Lerner_Model.pdf",
    "text": "At outer iteration k, the CPB broadcasts the current price (k) (k) system (⃗λt , νt ) to all households and firms.",
    "text_hash": "7e0e7ec07df6d3d09e6aacddeb0e8b66bbe59f1df2e6b99a97b82f76cd725d4c",
    "type": "theorem"
  },
